              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Base bephendula, bathi kuJesu: “Asazi. UJesu waphendula, wathi kubo: “Nami anginitsheli ukuthi ngenza lokhu ngagunya lini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
